<title>THAILAND: NTS Steel 1996 loss widens sharply.</title>
<headline>NTS Steel 1996 loss widens sharply.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)    loss     4.42     vs    loss    0.32</p>
<p>    Net	     loss   936.23     vs    loss   68.13</p>
<p>NOTES: Revs not stated. Company's full name is NTS Steel Group Plc, a steel mill operator.</p>
